01:03:44.850 --> 01:03:45.740
Right.

01:03:45.740 --> 01:03:47.905
The way that we, the way
that you express yourself--

01:03:47.905 --> 01:03:49.990
It's just yeah, I express
myself differently.

01:03:49.990 --> 01:03:53.630
So you can't beat yourself
up by holding yourself

01:03:53.630 --> 01:03:55.900
