01:03:55.900 --> 01:03:57.920
that shouldn't apply to you.

01:03:57.920 --> 01:03:59.080
Right.

01:03:59.080 --> 01:04:00.350
Yeah, and I just think that--

01:04:00.350 --> 01:04:02.099
And I think you--

01:04:02.099 --> 01:04:03.740
I just think that, like,
being hard on yourself,

01:04:03.740 --> 01:04:04.573
like who are you,

01:04:04.573 --> 01:04:07.580
who are you trying to please, right?

01:04:07.580 --> 01:04:10.220
Like, when you say that's what

