01:04:12.960 --> 01:04:17.140
I no longer believe that
there is a judgemental

01:04:17.140 --> 01:04:20.870
God watching me, and making
sure I do the right thing.

01:04:20.870 --> 01:04:25.330
I don't live by an ethic
that is based on potential

01:04:25.330 --> 01:04:27.140
