01:04:27.140 --> 01:04:29.580
That's not, I don't think
that way anymore, right?

01:04:29.580 --> 01:04:34.370
I think about what the tangible,

01:04:34.370 --> 01:04:37.820
experiential impact of my actions is.

01:04:37.820 --> 01:04:39.900
And it just so happens
that most of the things

01:04:39.900 --> 01:04:43.660
that most people would
consider moral are also things

01:04:43.660 --> 01:04:45.830
that you yourself will
benefit from, right?

01:04:45.830 --> 01:04:48.060
Like doing things for other people,

01:04:48.060 --> 01:04:52.098
ultimately you also will
benefit from those things.

01:04:52.098 --> 01:04:56.280
And I'm just saying, I
think that the idea of like,

01:04:56.280 --> 01:04:58.980
spending a lot of emotional energy

01:04:58.980 --> 01:05:00.280
sitting around and thinking about

01:05:00.280 --> 01:05:01.900
