01:05:05.548 --> 01:05:08.400
take the lesson, apply it for next time,

01:05:08.400 --> 01:05:10.030
but if you're just wallowing in it.

01:05:10.030 --> 01:05:11.440
I'm not really.

01:05:11.440 --> 01:05:14.880
It popped into my head with this prompt.

01:05:14.880 --> 01:05:16.230
But I'm not wallowing in it.

01:05:16.230 --> 01:05:18.730
But you said you still feel bad about it.

01:05:18.730 --> 01:05:21.980
It popped into my head, and
then I felt bad about it.

01:05:21.980 --> 01:05:26.940
But now I agree that I shouldn't
feel bad about it, at all.

01:05:29.080 --> 01:05:31.060
But you feel like kind of like maybe

01:05:31.060 --> 01:05:32.950
it's callous to say that.

01:05:32.950 --> 01:05:34.114
Yes.

01:05:34.114 --> 01:05:35.990
But it's not really.

01:05:35.990 --> 01:05:37.640
Cause it's misplaced,

01:05:37.640 --> 01:05:39.690
