Now, the expectation
at that point is like,

01:06:06.290 --> 01:06:09.660
oh, I gotta do something
to make this right.

01:06:09.660 --> 01:06:11.880
Like this isn't about me anymore.

01:06:11.880 --> 01:06:13.510
This is about something that's like,

01:06:13.510 --> 01:06:16.190
if you had been a better
friend to this guy,

01:06:16.190 --> 01:06:17.450
