01:06:21.670 --> 01:06:22.820
Yeah, he would never do that.

01:06:22.820 --> 01:06:24.050
Right.

01:06:24.050 --> 01:06:24.943
Cause yeah.

01:06:24.943 --> 01:06:27.010
So I guess what I'm saying is,

01:06:27.010 --> 01:06:30.830
it's just like, that's
a moment in which like,

01:06:30.830 --> 01:06:34.510
oh, I'm gonna, my own personal regret

